{"sections":[{"slug":"概形上的层语义","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"概形上的层语义"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形上的层语义</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"概形上的层语义"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">代数的谱</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">为局部环</span>, $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">综合谱</span></strong> (synthetic spectrum) <span lang=\"zh\">为代数同态的集合</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Spec}A = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Alg}(R)}(A,R).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为概形</span>, $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal O_X$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">那么在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/大Zariski意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">大</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Zar}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, $A^{\\mathrm{Zar}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的综合谱即为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对谱</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\underline{\\operatorname{Spec}}_X(A)$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong> (<span lang=\"zh\">综合拟凝聚性</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/IngoBlechschmidtInternalLanguageAG","text":"Ingo"}},{"Plain":" Definition 18.18).\n<span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">为局部环</span>, $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">若典范的</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模同态</span>\n$$\r\nE \\otimes_R A \\to E^{\\operatorname{Spec}A},\\,\r\n(x\\otimes f) \\mapsto (\\varphi\\mapsto \\varphi(f)x)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $E$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">综合拟凝聚</span></strong> (synthetically quasicoherent) $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}